                  <span style="display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #6B7280; margin-top: 2px;">2 for $139.90</span>
                  <span style="display: block; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; color: #9333EA; margin-top: 1px;">($69.95/ea)</span>
